can lead to</span> <strong data-start="3884" data-end="3919"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_71" data-source="" data-orig="price fluctuations of up to">price fluctuations of up to</span> 45%</strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_72" data-source="" data-orig="emphasizing the importance of reliable sourcing">emphasizing the importance of reliable sourcing</span>.</p></li></ul><p data-start="3973" data-end="3995"><strong data-start="3973" data-end="3993">质量控制:</strong></p><ul data-start="3996" data-end="4175"><li data-start="3996" data-end="4175"><p data-start="3998" data-end="4033"><strong data-start="3998" data-end="4031"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_73" data-source="" data-orig="Three-tier inspection system">Three-tier inspection system</span>:</strong></p><ol data-start="4036" data-end="4175"><li data-start="4036" data-end="4068"><p data-start="4039" data-end="4068"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_74" data-source="" data-orig="Field">Field</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_75" data-source="" data-orig="Test starch content">Test starch content</span>.</p></li><li data-start="4071" data-end="4115"><p data-start="4074" data-end="4115"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_76" data-source="" data-orig="Warehouse">Warehouse</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_77" data-source="" data-orig="Check reducing sugar values">Check reducing sugar values</span>.</p></li><li data-start="4118" data-end="4175"><p data-start="4121" data-end="4175"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_78" data-source="" data-orig="Pre-processing">Pre-processing</span>: <span class ="tr_" id="tr_79" data-source="" data-orig="Assess black spot disease incidence">Assess black spot disease incidence</span>.</p></li></ol></li></ul><hr data-start="4177" data-end="4180" /><h3 data-start="4182" data-end="4224"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="22_Cleaning_Peeling_and_Sorting"></span><strong data-start="4186" data-end="4224">2.2 打扫, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_80" data-source="" data-orig="Peeling">Peeling</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_81" data-sourc