te Management</span>:</strong></p><ul data-start="4635" data-end="4731"><li data-start="4635" data-end="4731"><p data-start="4637" data-end="4731"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_94" data-source="" data-orig="Peel residues are collected and transported as animal feed">Peel residues are collected and transported as animal feed</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_95" data-source="" data-orig="supporting sustainable operations">supporting sustainable operations</span>.</p></li></ul><hr data-start="4733" data-end="4736" /><h3 data-start="4738" data-end="4781"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="23_Slicing_Blanching_and_Cooking"></span><strong data-start="4742" data-end="4781">2.3 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_96" data-source="" data-orig="Slicing">Slicing</span>, 热烫, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_97" data-source="" data-orig="and Cooking">and Cooking</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="4783" data-end="5250"><li data-start="4783" data-end="4882"><p data-start="4785" data-end="4882"><strong data-start="4785" data-end="4797"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_98" data-source="" data-orig="Slicing">Slicing</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_99" data-source="" data-orig="Peeled potatoes cut into">Peeled potatoes cut into</span> <strong data-start="4823" data-end="4841">8<span class ="tr_" id="tr_100" data-source="" data-orig="–12 mm slices">–12 mm slices</span></strong>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_101" data-source="" data-orig="water is recirculated for efficiency">water is recirculated for efficiency</span>.</p></li><li data-start="4883" data-end="5053"><p data-start="4885" data-end="4996"><strong data-start="4885" data-end="4899">热烫:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_102" data-source="" data-orig="Destroys enzymes to prevent browning">Destroys enzymes to prevent browning</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_103" data-source="" data-orig="promotes starch gelatinization">promotes starch gelatinization</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_104" data-source="" data-orig="protects cell membranes">protects cell membranes</span>.</p><ul data-start="4999" data-end="5053"><li data-start="4999" data-end="5023"><p data-start="5001" data-end="5023">温度: 65–83°C</p></li><li data-start="5026" data-end="5053"><p data-start="5028" data-end="5053">期间: 15–35 分钟</p></li></ul></li><li data-start="5054" data-end="5177"><p data-start="5056" data-end="5177"><strong data-start="5056" data-end="5068">冷却:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_105" data-source="" data-orig="Counterflow cooling reduces temperature to ≤30°C">Counterflow cooling reduces temperature to ≤30°C</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_106" data-source="" data-orig="stabilizing starch and reducing free starch in the mash">stabilizing starch and reducing free starch in the mash</span>.</p></li><li data-start="5178" data-end="5250"><p data-start="5180" data-end="5250"><strong data-start="5180" data-end="5192">烹饪:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_107" data-source="" data-orig="Steam-cooked to full maturity">Steam-cooked to full maturity</span> (92<span class ="tr_" id="tr_108" data-source="" data-orig="–99°C">–99°C</span>, 15<span class ="tr_" id="tr_109" data-source="" data-orig="–45 minutes">–45 minutes</span>).</p></li></ul><p data-start="5252" data-end="5341"><strong data-start="5252" data-end="5266">参考:</strong> 琼斯 &amp; 棕色的, 2018, <a class="decorated-link cursor-pointer" target="_new" rel="noopener" data-start="5288" data-end="5340">DOI</a>.</p><hr data-start="5343" data-end="5346" /><h3 data-start="5348" data-end="5399"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="24_Mashing_Drying_Flaking_and_Packaging"></span><strong data-start="5352" data-end="5399">2.4 糖化, 烘干, 剥落, 和包装</strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h3><ul data-start="5401" data-end="5948"><li data-start="5401" data-end="5546"><p data-start="5403" data-end="5546"><strong data-start="5403" data-end="5415">糖化:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_110" data-source="" data-orig="Mashed potato produced via spiral feeder">Mashed potato produced via spiral feeder</span>; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_111" data-source="" data-orig="emulsifiers">emulsifiers</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_112" data-source="" data-orig="mono">mono</span>- <span class ="tr_" id="tr_113" data-source="" data-orig="and diglycerides">and diglycerides</span>) <span class ="tr_" id="tr_114" data-source="" data-orig="and citric acid prevent oxidation and stickiness">and citric acid prevent oxidation and stickiness</span>.</p></li><li data-start="5547" data-end="5628"><p data-start="5549" data-end="5628"><strong data-start="5549" data-end="5560">烘干:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_115" data-source="" data-orig="Drum drying with steam">Drum drying with steam</span> (120–240°C), <span class ="tr_" id="tr_116" data-source="" data-orig="moisture controlled below">moisture controlled below</span> 9%.</p></li><li data-start="5629" data-end="5730"><p data-start="5631" data-end="5730"><strong data-start="5631" data-end="5653">剥落 &amp; 筛分:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_117" data-source="" data-orig="Produces">Produces</span> <strong data-start="5663" data-end="5680">4<span class ="tr_" id="tr_118" data-source="" data-orig="–8 mm flakes">–8 mm flakes</span></strong>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_119" data-source="" data-orig="sieved to customer specification">sieved to customer specification</span> (16–40目).</p></li><li data-start="5731" data-end="5863"><p data-start="5733" data-end="5863"><strong data-start="5733" data-end="5772"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_120" data-source="" data-orig="Metal Detection">Metal Detection</span> &amp; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_121" data-source="" data-orig="Magnetic Removal">Magnetic Removal</span>:</strong> <span class ="tr_" id="tr_122" data-source="" data-orig="Double-layer">Double-layer</span> 8000 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_123" data-source="" data-orig="Gauss magnetic iron removers and inline metal detectors ensure safety">Gauss magnetic iron removers and inline metal detectors ensure safety</span>.</p></li><li data-start="5864" data-end="5948"><p data-start="5866" data-end="5948"><strong data-start="5866" data-end="5880">包装:</strong> 25 <span class ="tr_" id="tr_124" data-source="" data-orig="kg bags with batch traceability">kg bags with batch traceability</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_125" data-source="" data-orig="ISO/HACCP standards compliance">ISO/HACCP standards compliance</span>.</p></li></ul><hr data-start="5950" data-end="5953" /><h2 data-start="5955" data-end="5998"><span class="ez-toc-section" id="3_Additives_Fortification_Safety"></span><strong data-start="5958" data-end="5998">3. 添加剂, 筑城 &amp; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_126" data-source="" data-orig="Safety">Safety</span></strong><span class="ez-toc-section-end"></span></h2><ul data-start="6000" data-end="6336"><li data-start="6000" data-end="6181"><p data-start="6002" data-end="6025"><strong data-start="6002" data-end="6023">常用添加剂:</strong></p><ul data-start="6028" data-end="6181"><li data-start="6028" data-end="6070"><p data-start="6030" data-end="6070">盐 &amp; <span class ="tr_" id="tr_127" data-source="" data-orig="seasonings">seasonings</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_128" data-source="" data-orig="flavor enhancement">flavor enhancement</span>)</p></li><li data-start="6073" data-end="6124"><p data-start="6075" data-end="6124"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_129" data-source="" data-orig="Anti-caking agents">Anti-caking agents</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_130" data-source="" data-orig="ensure free-flowing powder">ensure free-flowing powder</span>)</p></li><li data-start="6127" data-end="6181"><p data-start="6129" data-end="6181"><span class ="tr_" id="tr_131" data-source="" data-orig="Fortification agents">Fortification agents</span> (<span class ="tr_" id="tr_132" data-source="" data-orig="vitamins C">vitamins C</span>, <span class ="tr_" id="tr_133" data-source="" data-orig="B complex">B complex</span>, 铁)</p></li></ul></li><li data-start="6182" data-end="6336"><p data-start